WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
These are your dividends

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,320
Eighteen thousand taels per person

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,840
That’s six boxes

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,320
Let your people carry it away

5
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,800
That big brother

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,120
Can I exchange it for a banknote? Can I exchange it for a banknote?

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,200
Take money home

8
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,440
My father will definitely kidnap me

9
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:24,830
I also want a banknote, Tian'er

10
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:32,760
This is the banknote you two want. What's going on, Master?

11
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,080
As you command, little one

12
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,240
Go to Shuntianfu Prison

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
Tell him and his son to shut up

14
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,040
But the little one just entered the prison

15
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,560
I saw two corpses

16
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,200
Hanging alone on the house grain

17
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:45,410
This is what my father meant

18
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:49,430
What's going on

19
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:51,910
Just leave this matter alone

20
00:00:51,910 --> 00:00:56,650
Keep peace of mind on your brewing business, Dudley.

21
00:00:56,650 --> 00:01:00,380
It seems that my wife took action.

22
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:01,700
prodigal son

23
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,740
Offended my wife

24
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:04,300
Let me see how you die
